# Front page

Import Layout.

## Page /

Head:
    <title>Acme — tools that stay out of the way</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Acme builds small, sharp tools for people who ship.">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Acme">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Small, sharp tools for people who ship.">

State:
    Let tagline be "Small, sharp tools for people who ship.".

View:
    {extends Site}
    {block content:}
      <h1>Acme</h1>
      <p class="lede">{tagline}</p>
    {end}

## Test: the front page says what Acme is and marks Home active

Expect that the text of "h1" is equal to "Acme".
Expect that the text of ".lede" is equal to "Small, sharp tools for people who ship.".
Expect that the count of "nav a" is equal to 4.
Expect that the count of "nav a.active" is equal to 1.
Expect that the text of "nav a.active" is equal to "Home".
